&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff"&gt;達成目標年度&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 67.67px"&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 399.46666666666666666666666667px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;柔軟な働き方&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;時間単位有給休暇制度、スーパーフレックスタイム制度、在宅勤務制度、フレキシブル休職制度、介護支援制度、服装の自由化&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 129.46666666666666666666666667px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;ワークエンゲージメント（ストレスチェック）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;51以上&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 54.533333333333333333333333333px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;49.6&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 64px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;2025年度&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 43.93px"&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 399.46666666666666666666666667px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;業務革新&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;社外からイントラネットが利用できる仮想デスクトップサービスの導入、決まった作業を自動化・効率化できるRPA（Robotic Process Automation）の活用、社内情報を効率的に活用できるBI（Business Intelligence）システムの導入&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1; margin-top: 8px; text-align: left"&gt;※対象者は当社従業員および当社から関係会社への出向者です。&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetricsMetricsAndTargetsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">女性管理職比率</jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
  <jpcrp_cor:MetricsUnitDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">％</jpcrp_cor:MetricsUnitDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
